    <?php foreach ($lines as $l): ?><tr><td><b><?= e($l['desc']) ?></b><?php if (!empty($l['sub'])): ?><br><small class="muted"><?= e($l['sub']) ?></small><?php endif; ?></td><td><?= (int) $l['qty'] ?></td><td class="right"><?= money($l['unit']) ?></td><td class="right"><?= money($l['qty'] * $l['unit']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="sl tot"><span>Total</span><span><?= money($q['total']) ?></span></div><?php if ($q['valid_until']): ?><p class="muted">Valable jusqu'au <?= fdate($q['valid_until']) ?>.</p><?php endif; ?><?php if ($q['admin_notes']): ?><div class="hl-box"><?= nl2br(e($q['admin_notes'])) ?></div><?php endif; ?>
